        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have a dedicated team focused on decreasing time to market and transitioning products to full volume manufacturing, through a full suite of integrated new product introduction services, such as design for excellence, product lifecycle assessment, specialized design of test solutions and rapid prototyping.",
